This is a project repo for working on the code repos listed in `repos.txt` with Claude Code.
The code repos are cloned into `~/code/{{project_name}}/`, which is not a Git repo.

## Set Up on a New Machine

```sh
git clone <this repo's URL> ~/proj/{{project_name}}
cd ~/proj/{{project_name}}
pixi run bootstrap   # clones the repos in repos.txt into ~/code/{{project_name}}
claude
```

`pixi run status` shows the state of each code repo.
`pixi run bootstrap` never changes existing clones.

## Add a Code Repo

Add a `<name> <url> [branch]` line to `repos.txt`, then run `pixi run bootstrap`, and commit.

## Update Against Template Changes

This project was created with
[copier-claude-project](https://github.com/avcopan/copier-claude-project).
To pull in changes to the template, run the following in a clean working tree.
```sh
pixi run copier-update
```
